### what that composes to
  walk() returns Ok(()) for a path that is not a directory, so load() returns
  Ok(empty) and the expect() never fires. A Registry with no rows makes every
  arm return an empty Vec, and every arm asserted empty passes.

### the shape of assertion that would still catch it
  a test asserting a finder NON-empty. Two exist:
    checks/tests/what_one_field_obliges_another_to_carry.rs:67:/// The ratchet above is green, and this is what says the green means anything.
